supatree
  j/k ↑↓   move
  ctrl+d/u half page
  gg / G   first / last
  } / {    next / prev tree
  wheel    scroll
  click    select

Folding
  space    fold this section
  h / l    close / open
  zM / zR  fold / unfold all

Open
  enter/o  agent, or shell
           on a repo row, PM
           on a PM row
  a        new named agent,
           repo agent on a
           repo
  p        new PM
  D        dashboard
  P        top PM
  m        hand this row to
           the top PM

Remove
  d        on a PM: remove
